Description: Web dashboard for PaoPao Gateway
 The bundled clash-dashboard (with the ppgw reload / net_rec / ppsub
 pages), installed to /etc/config/clash/clash-dashboard/ and served by
 the mihomo external-ui on the clash_web_port.
 Packaged separately so it can be updated or replaced independently.
